cellence\nand consider providing this wealth of education which surpasses all benefits, material\nriches can provide.\nWe are sure that a visit to our college will be a lasting memory to all of you.\nAuditorium\nSeminar Hall 1\nG J Hall\nSPORTS ARENA\nSeminar Hall 2\nAmphitheatre\nIndoor Stadium\n\n--- Page Break ---\n\n17/09/26\nDAY1\nEvents\nTime\nVenue\nReg. Fees\nCash Prize\nGROUP DANCE\n9:30 AM\nAuditorium\n500/-\n22500/-\nRANGOLI\n9:30 AM\nCollege Ground\n200/-\n3000/-\nSOLO SINGING\n10:00 AM\nSeminar Hall\n200/-\n6000/-\nBEST ACCOUNTANT\n10:00 AM\nRoom No.305\n200/-\n3000/-\nGAMING (BGMI)\n11:30 AM\nRoom No.301 &302\n300/-\n6000/-\nMEHENDI\n10:00 AM\nRoom No. 103\n200/\n3000/-\nBUSINESS PLAN FOR STARTUPS\n12:00 PM\nRoom No. 201\n300/-\n6000/\nSOLO DANCE - WESTERN & CLASSICAL\n12:30 PM\nGJ Hall\n200/-\n12000/\nFACE PAINTING\n12:30 PM\nRoom No. 102\n200/-\n3000/-\nDEBATE (KANNADA)\n12:00 PM\nRoom No.303\n200/-\n3000/-\nKAVITHA VACHAN\n12:00 PM\nRoom No.304\n200/-\n3000/-\nTUG OF WAR (BOYS & GIRLS)\n10:00 AM\nCollege Ground\n500/-\n20000/\nFASHION SHOW (CORP)\n3:00 PM\nAuditorium\n1000/-\n30000/-\n\n--- Page Break ---\n\nGroup Dance\nDAY1\nDate\n17/09/26\nPrize\nTime : 9:30 AM\n22500/-\nVenue : Auditorium\nParticipants : 6+2 in a team\nTime Limit : 4+1 mins\n1. Music should be in mp3 format\n2. Partcipants are required to submit the music to the\nevent co-ordinator at the registration desk\nn本mimis\n3. Judges decision will be final\n4. Any form of dance is allowed\nRegistration Fees : 500 /-\nYUVARAJ 8197383859\nSANTOSH S 9019718628"
